# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large experiment artifacts — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repo root with a leading slash. Unanchored `data/` matched at
# ANY depth, so it also ignored the `kgproweight/data/` SOURCE package — new
# modules added there were silently untracked (already-tracked files kept
# working, which is why this went unnoticed).
/data/
/indexes/
/checkpoints/
/outputs/
# 2026-08-23: these two were NOT ignored, so `git add .` tried to stage 151 GB
# of model weights and FAISS/BM25 indexes. `/models/` keeps the handful of
# already-tracked config/tokenizer files working (gitignore does not untrack),
# it only stops the *.safetensors shards from being added.
/models/
/indexes_wiki18/
/indexes_smoke/bm25/*.npy
.cache/
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.index
*.jsonl
!tests/**/*.jsonl

